e_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"https://getpsalm.org/r/cb15686874\r\n```php\r\n<?php\r\n  function data(): array {\r\n    return [];\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  /** @return array{0:Exception,1:Exception} */\r\n  function f(): array {\r\n    $ret = data();\r\n    assert($ret[0] instanceof Exception);\r\n    assert($ret[1] instanceof Exception);\r\n    return $ret;\r\n  }\r\n```\r\n**Expected**: no issues\r\n**Actual**:\r\n```\r\nPsalm output (using commit 348b8ee): \r\n\r\nINFO: MixedTypeCoercion - 11:5 - The type 'array<array-key, mixed>' is more general than the declared return type 'array{0:Exception, 1:Exception}' for f\r\n\r\nINFO: MixedTypeCoercion - 6:7 - The declared return type 'array{0:Exception, 1:Exception}' for f is more specific than the inferred return type 'array<array-key, mixed>'\r\n```\r\n**Workaround**:\r\n```php\r\n    return [$ret[0], $ret[1]];\r\n```\r\nhttps://getpsalm.org/r/56fd02d4e4\r\n\r\nSo it appears offset types are inferred, but not propagated to the containing array.","closed_by":{"login":"muglug","id":2292638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTI2Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2292638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug","html_url":"https://github.com/muglug","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reacti